<title>USA: FOB Gulf Grain - Basis values unchanged, tone weak.</title>
<headline>FOB Gulf Grain - Basis values unchanged, tone weak.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>FOB grain and soybean basis values were unchanged from Thursday, but the corn and soybean markets had weak undertones because of lower CBOT futures, traders said.</p>
<p>Corn and soybean supplies were expected to increase next week because forecasts call for clear weather then which should allow for rapid harvest progress, they said.</p>
<p>Wheat basis values were steady in very slow trade.  </p>
